# Optional local secret for `npm run scan`.
# Never commit a real webhook. On GitHub, add it as an Actions secret named DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL.
# The scanner reads this from the environment only. It is not written into data/*.json.
# DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Directory for seen-alerts.json, alerts-history.json, latest-scan.json, and rejections.json.
# DATA_DIR=./data

# Vite base path. GitHub Actions sets /glitch-hunter/ for Pages. Local default is /.
# VITE_BASE_PATH=/

# Where the static site reads live scan JSON. Defaults match this public repo.
# VITE_DATA_REPO=Herbncheese/glitch-hunter
# VITE_DATA_BRANCH=scanner-data
